        "original_id": "c92c9c52-c1af-5d45-b248-e30d1177ac46",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: JYP Entertainment\n- Groups: JJ Project, Got7\n- People: JB, Jinyoung, Mark, Jackson, Youngjae, BamBam, Yugyeom\n- Products: \"Bounce\", \"Got It?\", Verse 2\n\nFacts:\n- JYP Entertainment formed the South Korean pop duo JJ Project, which consists of JB and Jinyoung.\n- JJ Project released its first single, \"Bounce,\" in May 2012.\n- JYP Entertainment formed the South Korean boy group Got7.\n- Got7 is composed of seven members: JB, Mark, Jackson, Jinyoung, Youngjae, BamBam, and Yugyeom.\n- Got7 debuted in January 2014 with its first EP, \"Got It?\"\n- \"Got It?\" peaked at number two on the Gaon Album Chart and number one on Billboard's World Albums Chart.\n- Verse 2 is the first extended play by the South Korean male duo JJ Project.",
